<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>My Personal Website</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #f8efff;
      --card: #fffaff;
      --text: #563d69;
      --accent: #c79bea;
      --accent-dark: #995fc0;
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 28px 16px;
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;
      text-align: center;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    main {
      width: min(680px, 100%);
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 24px;
      background: var(--card);
      border: 2px solid var(--accent);
      border-radius: 22px;
      box-shadow: 0 6px 0 #e6d2f5;
    }
    h1, h2 { color: var(--accent-dark); }
    .decoration { letter-spacing: 5px; }
    section {
      margin-top: 18px;
      padding: 16px;
      background: var(--bg);
      border-radius: 14px;
    }
    a { color: var(--accent-dark); }
    footer { margin-top: 22px; font-size: .9rem; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main>
    <p class="decoration" aria-hidden="true">✧ ⋆ ˚｡⋆୨୧˚ ⋆｡˚ ⋆</p>
    <h1>♡ Hello, I'm [Your Name]! ♡</h1>
    <p>Welcome to my little corner of the internet!</p>

    <section>
      <h2>🎀 About Me</h2>
      <p>Hi! I'm [Your Name]. This is my personal website for my class project.</p>
      <p>You can edit this text to tell visitors a little about yourself.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>💗 My Interests</h2>
      <p>Music · Games · Art · Friends</p>
      <p>Replace these with some of your favorite things!</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>🌷 My Favorite Things</h2>
      <p>Favorite color: [Your Favorite Color]</p>
      <p>Favorite game: [Your Favorite Game]</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>🔗 My Links</h2>
      <p><a href="https://github.com/lacieward71-sudo">Visit my GitHub profile</a></p>
    </section>

    <footer>Made with ♡ by [Your Name]</footer>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
